  "prefLabel": "Puc 2202.09 Customer",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 2202.09 “Customer” means any person or entity in this state, including any governmental unit, which purchases electricity at retail, and is the customer of record on the utility account.\n\nSource. #13457, eff 10-12-22",
